OL,3,GNEWSACamera records 400 speeding       
OL,4,Avehicles in six weeks                  
OL,6,FMore than 400 vehicles have been       
OL,7,Frecorded speeding through a Yorkshire  
OL,8,Fvillage in the six weeks since a new   
OL,9,Froadside camera was installed.         
OL,11,FThe AutoSpeedWatch camera captures     
OL,12,Fdetails of vehicles travelling above   
OL,13,Fthe 30mph (48km/h) limit on the A166   
OL,14,Fthrough Wetwang.                       
OL,16,FUnlike traditional speed enforcement   
OL,17,Fcameras, being caught does not         
OL,18,Fautomatically result in a fine.        
OL,19,FInstead, the information can be used by
OL,20,Fpolice to send warning letters to      
OL,21,Fmotorists and identify repeat          
OL,22,Foffenders.                             
